The navigation sounds of Lutris's Big Picture mode.

They were made for Lutris: bigpicture/tools/make_sounds.py in the source
tree synthesizes them from sine waves, using no recordings or samples of
anything else.
They are under the same license as the rest of Lutris, the GNU General
Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version; see the
file LICENSE at the top of the Lutris source tree.

This directory is a sound pack like any other. To make your own, copy it
to ~/.local/share/lutris/bigpicture/sounds under another name and replace
the files; bigpicture/README.md in the source tree has the details.
